{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cfvabj6vSZMJ4AWiJYdE6","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**I recommend against the three-month study as proposed.** Renewal is due next month, so the study can't finish in time to inform the decision. By the time it reports, you'll already have renewed for a year or let the licence lapse.\n\n**The data you have already shows where to look.** 92% of exports come from six accounts. Asking those six customers will tell you more than three months of telemetry. Usage numbers show *that* they export PDFs, not *why*, or what dropping PDF would cost you.\n\n**Don't read too much into CSV usage.** These accounts using CSV doesn't mean PDF is redundant. PDFs are often for things CSV can't do: board packs, audit trails, compliance archives, or sending to clients. If PDF supports a regulatory or contractual workflow, removing it could put renewals at risk that are worth far more than £18k.\n\n**What I'd do in the next 2–3 weeks:**\n1. **Check the contracts** of the six accounts for any PDF export commitments or SLAs.\n2. **Have account managers ask each account** what they use PDF for and whether a CSV or print-to-PDF workaround would work.\n3. **Compare the £18k with the revenue at stake** from those six accounts.\n4. **Ask the vendor for flexible terms now**, such as a 3–6 month or monthly extension, or a cheaper tier for your low volume. That would make room for a study if one is still needed.\n5. **Price alternatives** in parallel, such as open-source or headless-browser PDF generation. Weigh the one-off engineering cost against £18k a year.\n\n**How to decide:** If any account depends on PDF and the alternatives cost more than about a year's licence, renew, ideally on shorter terms. If none do, let it lapse and give those accounts migration support."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3190,"cache_read_input_tokens":4993,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3190},"output_tokens":10,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"cdd3e06b-6785-4776-95a7-504bd7069e15","uuid":"184fe85d-2e94-4b44-b328-30cff181859d","timestamp":"2026-10-11T14:07:41.668Z","request_id":"req_011CfvabiqoCQm87ioqt54Kq"}
